=== The same program, the same evaluator, one line different ===
  lexical (fn.env)     -> 11
  dynamic (env)        -> 100

  11 means the body found the x that was in scope where 'fun' was
     written. 100 means it found the x in scope at the call.

=== Nested calls, same switch ===
  lexical              -> 2
  dynamic              -> 1000
